blockers() (lines 248-269) adds REMITTANCE_SUBMITTED, COLLECTION_SUBMITTED, INVOICE_PAID and MANUAL_INVOICE_AFTER only; the enum
has no COLLECTION_DATE_PASSED. Round 1's red IT log (02-red-it.log) shows RemittancesIT.R_12_14_E147 failing earlier, at line 200
(`requestedCollectionDate` absent from the period view), so it never reached the rollback call. Round 2's red log for the
rollback word (18-r2-red-it.log) shows the old single-word check: FITXER_NO_ENVIAT → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR {field: confirmation}.
